<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>risk-bench · annotation review</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,500;8..60,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/theme.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/review-shared.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/review.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="brand"><span class="dice">⚂</span> risk-bench<small>annotation review · <span id="tournamentId"></span></small></div>
    <div class="mastmeta"><a id="tournamentLink" href="#">← tournament</a></div>
  </div>
</header>
<main class="shell">
  <section class="card section pad" aria-label="Review samples">
    <div class="controls">
      <label>Sample <select id="sampleSelect"></select></label>
      <span id="sampleMeta" class="mute"></span>
    </div>
    <details id="newSample">
      <summary>Draw a new sample</summary>
      <p class="note">The sample is drawn once with a recorded seed and saved before any review. Findings are
        stratified by type and final status, with a floor per stratum so rare outcomes appear; the report
        reweights by population size. Messages are drawn uniformly from all games and reviewed blind.</p>
      <form id="sampleForm" class="controls">
        <label>Commitments <input id="sampleCommitments" type="number" min="0" value="40"></label>
        <label>Deceptions &amp; candidates <input id="sampleDeceptions" type="number" min="0" value="20"></label>
        <label>Messages <input id="sampleMessages" type="number" min="0" value="60"></label>
        <label>Floor per stratum <input id="sampleFloor" type="number" min="0" value="5"></label>
        <label>Seed <input id="sampleSeed" type="number" min="0" placeholder="random"></label>
        <label>Runs <select id="sampleBatch"><option value="">Newest whole-game run per game</option></select></label>
        <button class="btn dark" type="submit" id="drawSample">Draw sample</button>
      </form>
      <p id="sampleError" class="error" role="alert"></p>
    </details>
    <ul id="sampleWarnings" class="warnings"></ul>
  </section>

  <section id="queues" class="queues" hidden aria-label="Review queues"></section>
  <section id="reportPanel" hidden aria-label="Report"></section>
</main>
<script src="/assets/review.js"></script>
<script>
startReview({{ tournament_id_json }});
</script>
</body>
</html>
